From 54b803853aa2f6d12a14d625eb8833d5eb29eb34 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pieroviano <piero.viano@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 02:35:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Anchoring: anchor invisible children, seed added controls,
 measure a form's first-allocation resize from what the window opened at

Invisible children are anchored like visible ones, a control added after layout started follows the next resize, a form's first real pass compares the content-area size with the designed client size (no status-strip / unhonoured-Width / maximized-at-open errors), Control.ClientSize re-bases the anchor, and visibility changes re-run layout only on change and not while suspended.
